    "list": [
      {
        "id": "ambient_1",
        "category": "ambient",
        "text": "The candles are lit and the cards are resting. We begin whenever you are ready.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "ambient_2",
        "category": "ambient",
        "text": "The room is quiet tonight, the way it always is before a message arrives.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "ambient_3",
        "category": "ambient",
        "text": "Somewhere beyond the screen the moon is doing her slow, patient work.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "ambient_4",
        "category": "ambient",
        "text": "Breathe with me for a moment. The circle is open and there is no hurry.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "ambient_5",
        "category": "ambient",
        "text": "The smoke curls upward and forgets where it was going. I like that about it.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "ambient_6",
        "category": "ambient",
        "text": "Night keeps its own counsel. I keep mine, and sometimes I share it with you.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "welcome_1",
        "category": "welcome",
        "text": "Welcome back to the circle. The candles are lit and the deck is warm.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "welcome_2",
        "category": "welcome",
        "text": "You found your way here again. The spirits noticed before I did.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "welcome_3",
        "category": "welcome",
        "text": "Come in, sit close. The room is quiet and the cards are listening.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "welcome_4",
        "category": "welcome",
        "text": "Welcome, wanderer. Whatever brought you here brought you at the right time.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "welcome_5",
        "category": "welcome",
        "text": "The door was never locked. Welcome to Mystic Witch Live.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "story_1",
        "category": "story",
        "text": "There was once a girl who could hear the river speak. She never told anyone, and the river never stopped talking.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "story_2",
        "category": "story",
        "text": "They say a witch once traded her reflection for a single true answer. She never regretted it, and she never looked in mirrors again.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "story_3",
        "category": "story",
        "text": "In the old quarter every house had a key that opened no door. The keys were the point.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "story_4",
        "category": "story",
        "text": "A sailor carried a candle through nine storms. It never lit, and it never went out.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "story_5",
        "category": "story",
        "text": "The fortune teller kept one card face down her whole life. Her last words were, not yet.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "story_6",
        "category": "story",
        "text": "A crow learned a single word and refused to use it. The village waited years, and the crow enjoyed every moment.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "tarot_1",
        "category": "tarot",
        "text": "The Moon is not a warning. It is an invitation to walk carefully through what you cannot see.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "tarot_2",
        "category": "tarot",
        "text": "The Tower frightens people, but it only removes what was already falling.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "tarot_3",
        "category": "tarot",
        "text": "Death in the cards is rarely about endings. It is the quiet after a long fever.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "tarot_4",
        "category": "tarot",
        "text": "The Star asks for nothing but your attention. That is why it is so often missed.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "tarot_5",
        "category": "tarot",
        "text": "The Hermit carries a lamp, not a torch. Some truths only survive a small light.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "tarot_6",
        "category": "tarot",
        "text": "Every suit has a season. Cups for what we feel, swords for what we think, wands for what we chase, pentacles for what we carry.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "engagement_1",
        "category": "engagement",
        "text": "Tell me what has been on your mind today. The cards are patient, and so am I.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "engagement_2",
        "category": "engagement",
        "text": "If you could ask one question and be guaranteed a true answer, what would it be?",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "engagement_3",
        "category": "engagement",
        "text": "Type the first word that comes to you. We will see what it stirs.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "engagement_4",
        "category": "engagement",
        "text": "Some of you are here for the reading. Some of you are here for the quiet. Both are welcome.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "engagement_5",
        "category": "engagement",
        "text": "What is one thing you are ready to leave behind this month?",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "engagement_6",
        "category": "engagement",
        "text": "The chat is part of the circle tonight. Say something, and I will answer.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "reading_1",
        "category": "reading",
        "text": "If a question has been circling you for days, a reading may give it somewhere to land.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "reading_2",
        "category": "reading",
        "text": "One card is enough for a single question. Three cards are for a story that has not finished.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "reading_3",
        "category": "reading",
        "text": "I can draw for you whenever you are ready. The deck does not judge the question.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "reading_4",
        "category": "reading",
        "text": "A reading is not a verdict. It is a lantern held at a different angle.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "reading_5",
        "category": "reading",
        "text": "Send your question, and I will let the cards answer in their own slow language.",
        "contexts": [
          "any"
        ],
        "enabled": true,
        "custom": false,
        "edited": false,
        "createdAt": null
      },
